 Enclaves</a><a href="jakiisi.html">Jakiisi</a><a href="tyrisaz.html">Tyrisaz</a></div></details><details data-group="locations"><summary>Locations of Note</summary><div class="sidebar-links"><a href="locations.html">Overview</a><a href="locations.html#fahroway">Fahroway</a><a href="locations.html#mothua">Mothua</a><a href="locations.html#ekternau">Ekternau</a><a href="locations.html#krashqkanov">Krashq’kanov</a></div></details><details data-group="bestiary"><summary>Bestiary</summary><div class="sidebar-links"><a href="bestiary.html">Overview</a><a href="bestiary.html#the-great-seas">The Great Seas</a><a href="bestiary.html#fahroway">Fahroway</a><a href="bestiary.html#ekternau">Ekternau</a></div></details><details data-group="beings"><summary>Beings of Note</summary><div class="sidebar-links"><a href="beings-of-note.html">Overview</a><a href="beings-of-note.html#fahroway">Fahroway</a><a href="beings-of-note.html#krashqkanov">Krashq’kanov</a><a href="beings-of-note.html#mothua">Mothua</a><a href="beings-of-note.html#ekternau">Ekternau</a></div></details><details data-group="tongues"><summary>Order of Tongues</summary><div class="sidebar-links"><a href="order-of-tongues.html">The Tongue of Shrikes</a></div></details></nav></aside>
